window.products.push({"id":971064,"name":"T-fal FF1228 Compact 1200-Watt Cool Touch Electric Deep Fryer with Adjustable Temperature and 1.8-Liter Oil Capacity, 2.2-Pound, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rfue6H6qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Prepare medium-size batches of delicious fried food with this T-fal FF122851 compact deep fryer. The unit offers a wide range of cooking possibilities, yet takes up minimal space on the countertop and can be easily stored. Use it to make breakfast fare, appetizers, side dishes, main courses, and desserts. The machine holds up to 1.6 liters of oil and up to 2.2 pounds of fresh food (about three servings). The 1600-watt fryer’s concealed heating element quickly and efficiently heats oil, and its temperature indicator light lets you know when oil has reached the correct frying temperature. A simple slide of the lever is all it takes to adjust the heat, and an easy-to-read, on-board guide lists temperature settings and coordinating food icons for quick reference. The unit’s frying basket provides a heat-resistant handle for safely lowering food into hot oil and raising it up when finished cooking, allowing excess oil to drain away. Other highlights include a viewing window for safe monitoring, an odor filter to prevent cooking smells from escaping, automatic lid opening, a fixed bowl, and a sleek, black, cool-touch exterior. Combining exceptional convenience in a space-efficient size, the T-fal FF122851 compact deep fryer makes it easy to prepare restaurant-quality fried food for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rfue6H6qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B0027FFQEQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971064","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0027FFQEQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0027FFQEQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
