window.products.push({"id":971078,"name":"17 Pieces Sushi Making Kit Bamboo Sushi Mat All In One Sushi Bazooka Maker Sushi Tools with Bamboo Mats, Bamboo Chopsticks, Paddle, Spreader, dipping ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NZCpQADtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MAKING SUSHI IS NEVER EASIER! For beginner just about starting the sushi journey to professional sushi chef or to any culinary student. It's great for anyone who just wants a making at home sushi kind of night. So get this kit and do it yourself or with friends and family! Or experience this moment with your children and make sushi together once in a while GREAT GIFT GIVING IDEA Present this kit to your friends or loved ones who love to cook or enjoy eating sushi. Our sushi kit makes a unique and useful gift to anyone you cherish. 17Piece Complete Sushi Rolling Kit Consists of: 1 * Sushi Bazooka 1 * Bamboo Mat 1 * Paddle 1 * Spreader 1 * Sushi Plate 4 * Bamboo Chopsticks 2 * Dipping Plate 4 * Chopsticks Holder 1 * Cotton Bag NOTE！ 1.When you receive the sushi suit, you will smell some bamboo with naturally distributes an aroma, which is a normal phenomenon. 2.When you use it for the first time, you must soak the Paddle、Spreader and Bamboo Mat in warm water for six hours. Wait for the bamboo to dry naturally, and the smell will be reduced 3.These products is made of bamboo, naturally distributes an aroma.Normally, different set could have some color or grain differences. It is safe for use as long as there is no splits and perforations. 4.Dry thoroughly to storage after wash. 5.Dishwasher is not recommended to wash.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NZCpQADtL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kairan","source_asin":"B089ZXXYZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089ZXXYZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089ZXXYZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
