window.products.push({"id":971082,"name":"Redecker Natural Pig Bristle Toilet-Brush with Untreated Beechwood Handle, 14-1/2-Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.57,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71glIsVH8-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your bathroom toilet effortlessly clean with the Redecker Natural Pig Bristle Toilet-Brush with Untreated Beechwood Handle Great for efficiently scrubbing toilet bowls until they sparkle, this long-lasting brush comes with an elegant beechwood stand. Made from durable untreated beechwood, the stand resists rust, cracks, chipping and corrosion. The toilet brush features high-grade pig bristle that is stiff enough to eliminate tough stains and sturdy enough for regular use. Outfitted with an untreated beechwood handle that is naturally resistant to gouging, chipping and general wear and tear, the brush handle attaches to the stand for vertical space-saving storage and easy retrieval and is perfect for any style bathroom. Before being strung into the brush head, the pig bristle is cleaned, scoured and combed in a multi-stage process. This finishing treatment ensures the utmost quality and optimizes the benefits of pig bristles. For maintenance, it is recommended to clean with a mild soap and warm water solution. Towel blot to remove excess moisture and hang to air dry with bristles facing down to prevent damage to wooden handle. Brush measures 14-1/2\" long. Made in Germany. The first handcrafted Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes were produced in 1935. A lot has changed since then. Today, the name Bürstenhaus Redecker stands as it has for many years for an ideal combination of natural quality, function and design. It lives from the blend of inventiveness, sound craftsmanship and creativity. Handcrafted in Germany, Bürstenhaus Redecker brushes are made of domestic woods, bristles, hair, and plant fibers, and have been for decades. Precedence is given to natural, sustainable raw materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71glIsVH8-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REDECKER","source_asin":"B00791K88W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00791K88W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00791K88W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":971083,"name":"Electric Can Opener, Kitchen Safety Automatic Can Opener, Smooth Edge, Food-Safe and Battery Operated Electric Can Openers Prime for Seniors and Arthr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nud0Wh3nL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Can opener is a must-have kitchen tool for every family. A reliable electric can opener will ensure a good job for you every time you open a can. Operating the Can Opener: Step1 - Place the Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove between the Cutter and the Drive Wheel Step2 - With the can on a flat surface, press the Button for about one second and release, then the Can Opener will start cutting the side of the can Step3 - When the cutting has completed, press the button immediately to reverse the cutter Step4 - Make sure that the cutter resets to the start position and the motor stops. Then, lift the can opener off the can At a Glance: ? Start and stop feature for hands-free opening ? Automatically open cans in seconds, operated by 2AA batteries (Not Included) ? Sleek, low profile design for easy storage ? Hygienic - Cuts from side of can without leaving sharp edges, lid will never falls into can and touch on food ? Materials - ABS, TPE, Stainless Steel Package Contains: 1Electric Can Opener 1Product specification","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nud0Wh3nL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GWolffy","source_asin":"B08YYLHY55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YYLHY55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YYLHY55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
