window.products.push({"id":971185,"name":"Newair Evaporative Cooler 412 CFM 215 sq. ft. Portable Freestanding Home Air Cooler 3 Fan Speeds Dual Direction Oscillation White Evap Cooler","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":195.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WqkyuCllS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The NewAir Frigidaire 2-in-1 Evaporative Air Cooler and Tower Fan Overview: Think you don't have space for an evaporative cooler in your home? Think again! The Frigidaire Evaporative Air Cooler is carefully designed to take up less than one square foot of floor space — and look great doing it. The tall, slim design provides the power of a dual-oscillating tower fan while remaining lightweight and easily portable. This modernized swamp cooler is designed with hidden wheels for a clean look that works in any decor. Plus, with a removable water tank, sleek LED controls, and a remote control, you get the perfect combination of form and function. Features: 1. Compact Design for Small Spaces The Frigidaire Evaporative Air Cooler brings the power of evaporative cooling to even the tiniest spaces. This narrow design takes up less than one square foot of floor space, so it fits just about anywhere. 2. Hidden Caster Wheels for a Clean Look Lightweight design and four universal caster wheels let you move this evaporative cooler from room to room for relief from the heat — all while remaining hidden in the stylish base. All this and a contemporary design that puts boxy air coolers to shame? That's a win-win! 3. Thoughtful Features for Total Convenience The Frigidaire Evaporative Air Cooler has a removable, 1.5-gallon water tank for easy, drip-free refills. You can also customize your comfort at the touch of a button with an updated LED display, nine-hour timer and included remote control. 4. Efficient, Affordable Cooling for Desert Climates Evaporative cooling is the ideal solution for arid climates west of the Mississippi River. As the fan pulls hot, dry air across the honeycomb pad's surface, water turns from liquid into gas, providing a refreshing breeze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WqkyuCllS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NewAir","source_asin":"B0C4C628ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4C628ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4C628ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
