window.products.push({"id":971204,"name":"Fashion Bed Group Euro Platform Bed with Side Rails and Soft Upholstered Exterior, Queen, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wk6jH+5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With its sleek European-style platform, the Euro Platform Bed is a fashionable option that would easily fit in a modern, uptown loft, but could realistically work anywhere. Constructed with a solid wood interior frame for stability and years of everyday use, the exterior’s soft yet durable synthetic leather material adds sophistication to the design and the pure White color retains a classical simplicity. The unpretentious 37-inch headboard and 17-inch footboard are 4.5-inches thick and displays a low-profile design that showcases a minimalistic approach. The side rails and Euro wood slat deck provides a bed support system that can be used with just a mattress, and doesn't need the use of a box spring. A good ornamental bed, like the Euro, will fuse with the surrounding décor, accent other bedroom furniture and transform an ordinary room into something interesting and sophisticated. This unit includes a headboard, footboard, side rails, bed support system, instruction sheet, and hardware bag with everything needed for bed assembly. The Leggett & Platt Euro Platform Bed comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wk6jH+5kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B076BD7JWT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971204","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076BD7JWT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076BD7JWT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
