window.products.push({"id":971286,"name":"GoWoo 100% Silicone Reusable Storage Bag, Food Grade, Easy Cleaning, Dishwasher-Safe, Eco-friendly, Non-Toxic (Set of 4 Size, White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X4PJwt4eS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Maintain The Freshness Of Your Food & Keep Your Fridge Organized With Our Reusable Food Storage Bags!  We wanted to bring you reusable food storage bags that would provide just the right fit for your everyday needs to reduce your reliance on plastic bags to help lower your plastic waste output without sacrificing convenience.  Our stand-up reusable storage bags offer more storage space while being compact and easy to store. They are designed to stand upright making it easier to fill them and take less space in the fridge than traditional flat bags to help save space. Food Grade Silicone & Multi-Purpose – Made For Everyday Use  The silicone freezer bags are made using only food-grade silicone without any PVA, Lead, BPA, or other harsh materials to make sure you can safely use it daily. They are perfect for storing anything ranging from produce to snacks and more.  Our reusable silicone snack bags use a secure zipper that creates an airtight seal to protect anything you store inside and keeps it fresh. They are dishwasher safe and air dry quickly to make sure the reusable food bags are ready to use when you need them. Features You’ll Love: - Dishwasher safe, microwave safe, and freezer safe - They can be used as fresh fruit containers for fridge - Can easily be cleaned and reused for long term use - Ideal for fruits, vegetables, liquids, snacks, and more - Help preserve the freshness of your food at home and on the go Reduce Reliance On Plastic Bags & Organize Your Kitchen With Our Reusable Food Storage Clear Bag Set!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51X4PJwt4eS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoWoo","source_asin":"B092QJHM2H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092QJHM2H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092QJHM2H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
