window.products.push({"id":971302,"name":"Kate and Laurel Sylvie Blue Fish Linocut Print Framed Canvas Wall Art by Giuliana Lazzerini, 18x24 Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818W0es0itL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The artist, Giuliani Lazzerini, portrays a beautiful animal scene featuring a small school of blue fish in fantastic contemporary design in this canvas print titled, \"Fishes Blue\" Printed and framed in the USA in Waunakee, Wisconsin, this framed floating canvas art will be a pleasure to look at every day in your living room, bedroom, nursery, or any room in the home. Printed on gallery wrapped canvas, it has two hangers already attached to the natural wood colored MDF back for easy wall display. The outer dimensions are 24 inches tall by 18 inches wide by 1. 6 inches deep. Artist Biography: GIULIANA LAZZERINI From the United Kingdom Giuliana Lazzerini is an artist and printmaker based in York, UK. Giuliana became inspired during her childhood when much of her time was spent in her father’s studio in Tuscany. Nature dominates her linocut prints, with deer, hares & birds featuring alongside the cottages of Yorkshire, the medieval walls of York & the hills of Tuscany, often with an abstract quality. Giuliana gained a Master of Arts from the Istituto D’Arte Stagio Stagi in Pietrasanta and studied a further four years in painting at the Accademia Di Belle Arti in Carrara.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818W0es0itL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B07JDF1PRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JDF1PRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JDF1PRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
