window.products.push({"id":971479,"name":"HOMELUX THEORY Over The Sink Dish Drying Rack | Premium Stainless Steel | Sturdy 33.5\" Kitchen Rack. Above Sink Dish Rack Shelf Kitchen Counter Organi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fYvQUDaPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐ Find your counter space! While the Homelux Theory Sink Rack does the obvious – like drying dishes without counter clutter – it’s the other things that make it one of the best kitchen must haves. Like its No-Bend 88lb Load Capacity, Anti-Skid Feet and Anti-Rust SGS Certification. But most important, that we have NINE (9) different variations so the one you choose today is guaranteed perfect. ⭐ Fits every sink: Big sink or small kitchen? No problem because we have all sizes to fit! Our Small dishes drying rack is 31.1” wide, Medium is 33.5”/33.9 for your standard 32” sink (available in regular and double-frame). Large is 37.4” wide, and finally we offer an Adjustable Over the Sink Organizer 33.4 – 39.3” for oversized sinks. Measure your sink now, and choose the size that fits best in your home. ⭐ 13-in-1 max storage: The Homelux Theory Dish Drain comes with everything you could possibly need for dish drying. 9 Accessories in fact! Plate Rack, Bowl & Pot Tray, Fruit & Vege Basket (or Cup Drainer), Knife Holder, Chopping Board Holder, Sink Tray for Dish Soap and Brushes, Double Cutlery Drainer, Cup Strainer, and 5x Utensil Hooks. No Paper Towel Rod because No one likes soggy paper towels! ⭐ Strong 88lb load: Go ahead and drain your cast iron pan because this Heavy Duty Metal Dish Drying Rack won’t bend, buckle or sag under the weight of your pots and pans. Anti-Skid Suction Feet keep your two tier dish rack firmly in place, while the 12.5” Deep Base is perfectly balanced for stability. And if you have a counter Island sink, then check out our Double-Frame Variation made just for you. ⭐ English instruction: The Homelux Theory Dish Over Sink Drainer Rack is easy to assemble and comes with all the tools you need. Also comes with 30-Day Money Back Guarantee if needed. Stand 20.5” Tall to easily clear 16.5” faucets and won’t block your line of sight washing dishes. So, if you’re ready to ditch the nasty drip trays and regain ALL counter and sink space why not try Homelux Theory now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fYvQUDaPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMELUX THEORY","source_asin":"B088DN8MCM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971479","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088DN8MCM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088DN8MCM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":971480,"name":"hyha 3 Pieces Stretch Loveseat Slipcovers - Soft Couch Covers for 2 Cushion Couch, Washable Furniture Protector, Sofa Cover for Living Room with Elast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CvJKIEoEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH-QUALITY POLYESTER FABRIC: Polyester fabric is sturdy and more durable than natural fiber fabrics, and has a distinctive smooth and soft feel. Super elasticity and abrasion resistance, even if the couch protector stretch for a long time, it will not deform. The loveseat covers dries quickly. You can wash the stretch sofa cover in the morning and then reinstall it on the sofa in the afternoon. SUPER FIT: The fabric made of polyester and the unique production process make the sofa covers for 2 cushion couch softer and more flexible, just like a custom slipcovers for sofas, suitable for different sofas. Chair cover (for seat width 32\" -48\"), loveseat covers (for seat width 58\" -72\") and sofa cover (for seat width 72\" -96\"). Please measure your size before ordering. FULL PROTECTOR: hyha Loveseat covers for 2 cushion couch can not only protect your sofa from daily wear, scratches or accidental spills from children, pets, dogs, but also make your old sofa look new, update your home decor and save you money by extend the life of the sofa. STAY IN PLACE: Including 1 piece of base cover and 2 cushion covers, even if children bounce on the sofa, pets play on the sofa, or sleep on the sofa, cover for loveseat sofa still stay in the sofa. With elastic straps on the bottom edges, just pass the straps through the bottom of the sofa, and insert the hook into the loop on the front side. EASY TO PUT AND CLEAN: The unique fabric can make pet hair to remove quickly with a hair remover, and sofa cover loveseat can wash with a washing machine, which is simple and convenient. According to the installation instruction manual, one person can quickly install it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CvJKIEoEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hyha","source_asin":"B093P86Y64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093P86Y64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093P86Y64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
