window.products.push({"id":971681,"name":"FRESHMINT Weighted Blankets (20 lbs, 60''x80'') Heavy Blanket W/Removable Duvet Cover | for Individual Between 190-240 lbs | Full/Queen/King Sized Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dlsfQku+L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"The Freshmint Weighted Blanket emulates the feeling of a comforting hug, and can help you fall asleep faster and sleep better throughout the night.  Take a nap, cuddle up, watch TV, or read a book. The Freshmint Weighted Blanket isn’t just ideal for a good night’s sleep - it’ll bring calm, comfort, and coziness to any time, day or night! How to choose the right Freshmint Weighted Blanket? Choose the blanket that weighs about 10% of your body weight plus one. A weighted blanket is supposed to on the top of the mattress and should not go over the edges of bed; when using with children or seniors, ensure the individual has enough strength to move the blanket off themselves if necessary. Reminder: ❤weighted blankets are designed to be used by individuals for optimal weight distribution. Each member of a couple should use his or her own weighted blanket.  ❤Protect your blanket from direct source of heat. As heat could damage the glass pellets inside.  ❤To maximize the lifespan of your weighted blanket, we recommend spot cleaning whenever possible and using a duvet so washing the blanket itself is less necessary.  ❤Freshmint weighted blanket is the most breathable one due to the unique technologies in manufacturing so it boosts better temperature control than others. But it may also feel hot for hot sleepers in warm days due to its weight, so a fan or an AC is recommended in summer. In cold days just add a FRESHMINT minky quilted duvet cover which can add warmth & snug feeling.  ❤If you are tall than 5’5”, you should choose queen or king size weighted blanket with the length over 80” long, or your feet may stick out the weighted blanket.  For the first few nights, you may feel it is too heavy or too light weight. Getting used to a weighted blanket takes about 2-7 days, please bear with the magic weighted blanket a few more days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dlsfQku+L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRESHMINT","source_asin":"B07MFPD13C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971681","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MFPD13C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MFPD13C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
