window.products.push({"id":971730,"name":"Knife Sharpener 4-in-1 +Bonus Mini Professional Chef's Choice Scissors Sharpener Kitchen Camping Tools Gadgets Sharpening - Portable Mini Included - B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E+v+DLE6L._AC_SL1139_.jpg","description":"❤️ Everyone who owns a knife, needs a knife sharpener. ❤ All knives lose their edge over time. The metal wears away, the blade chips and bends on bones and root vegetables, acids corrode it and it rusts in the sink. A dull knife is a dangerous knife. To keep it working well, you need to sharpen it regularly. Our Sharpener is your Best Choice. The Vanicci Goods 4-in-1 Multi-Purpose Knife Sharpener Uses Two Pieces of Tungsten Carbide (Diamond and Ceramic) in a 'V' Formation to Polish and Grind Away the Metal on Either Side of The Blade, Creating a New, Sharp Edge. A Great Way to Easily Revive a Blunt Blade. Much Faster than With a Whetstone and Oil. 🔪 Never a Dull Moment ❤ Specifications: 8L x 1.7W x 3.5 H Inches Please Note: Serrated Blades Require A Unique Sharpening Technique, Do Not Use This Style of Sharpener with ANY Serrated Blades. ◈ For Best Results ◈ Pull in One Direction ONLY. Apply Even Pressure, Keep Blade Perpendicular to Table, Do not Swing Left /Right. Sharpening Scissors; Find Suitable Angle in the Lightning Slot, Push and Pull Evenly. How To Sharpen in Under a Minute: 1.  Simply Press Dull Edge into Coarse Slot, Starting at the Handle. Pull it Backwards 5-7 Times, All the Way to the Tip 2. Place the Blade into Fine Slot, Repeat, Pulling in One Direction, Backward . 3. Place into Essence Slot, Pull it Back 5-7 Times Never use your knife directly after sharpening. Sharpening produces microscopic bits of metal. After sharpening, wash or wipe blade with a dish cloth. 🎁 We are so confident in the quality of our knife sharpener that we offer a 100% Satisfaction Guarantee and Manufacturer Warranty. ❤️ The Only Sharpener You Will Ever Need. Add it to Your Cart and See for Yourself","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61E+v+DLE6L._AC_SL1139_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vanicci Goods","source_asin":"B084GTH6YY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084GTH6YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084GTH6YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
