window.products.push({"id":971770,"name":"30 Watt Silicone Wine Glass Holder for Bath & Shower, Give The Gift of an at Home Spa Bathtub Relaxation","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61829AzJ+3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE ORIGINAL WINE HOLDER FROM 30 WATT: No suction cups, adhesives or wall mounts are needed. Won’t leave residue behind, either. The Silicone grips securely to glossy surfaces like glass, mirror, marble, metal, shiny tile and laminate using a patented grip technology. That’s right, PATENTED. INSTALLATION IS AS EASY AS WASHING YOUR FRONT PARTS: Remove protective film from back and mount it on to a dry surface, smooth out the air bubbles, wait 24 hours, and then you’re ready to get the shower party started. REAPPLY TO SUIT YOUR MOODS: Moving your Wine Holder is just as easy. Simply peel it off the wall and stick it where it feels right. You will have to wait another 24 hours though, so be sure to time it right. DESIGNED BY BRAINY ENGINEERS: Revolutionary drainage system utilizes holes on the bottom to keep your holder from filling with water. That’s why they make the big bucks. THE GIFT THAT KEEPS ON GIVING: An incredibly thoughtful choice for the COCKTAIL drinker in your life. They’ll be thinking of you nearly every time they’re soaking wet and naked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61829AzJ+3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"30 Watt","source_asin":"B07HGG3SPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HGG3SPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HGG3SPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
