window.products.push({"id":971807,"name":"RCR 25832020006 Water Glass, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MuXa0ivdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The key features of Luxion are its transparency, hydrolytic resistance and dishwasher-proof nature. Luxion Brilliance: The brightest material on the crystal glass scene. The Refraction Value of Luxion Luxion Transparency: An ultra-clear glass that complies with European Standard ISO/PAS IWA 8:2009 since it meets the minimum requisites for absence of colour and transparency (internal transmission over two centimetres in excess of 98.8%) with ample margins. With these characteristics Luxion is the ideal material for tastings and for the HORECA and hospitality sector since it enhances the sensorial profile and analysis of any beverage it contains, in no way altering the taste of its contents. Machinability: Unlike less prized materials, Luxion is formulated to allow the moulding of complex, even extreme shapes, which is a precious feature for manufacturers but also for users, who can easily appreciate the results. Hydrolytic Resistance and Dishwasher-Proof The hydrolytic class is an important parameter for a material that is in contact with food, because it expresses the material’s tendency to release substances. Luxion offers better resistance to detergent action and excellent strength and stability during dishwasher use, tested for over 1,000 real washes without a hint of clouding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MuXa0ivdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RCR","source_asin":"B01AA92UVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AA92UVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AA92UVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
