window.products.push({"id":971968,"name":"Village Candle French Lavender, Medium Bowl Scented Candle, 14 oz, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.3,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416YTK61HEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Village Candle French Lavender, Medium Bowl, 14 net ounces with notes of french lavender, iris, and rosemary. Often referred to as the soul of Provence, few experiences can compare with the sight and scent of a lavender-blooming French countryside in springtime. Both scent and color create the most spectacular show. To capture this dazzling scene we’ve stayed true to the deepest essence of French lavender, blending it with notes of majestic iris blooms and subtly sprinkling a hint of rosemary for a fresh herbal quality. About Us: Proudly produced in America, Village Candles are made with care, trimmed by hand, and artfully crafted for each and every consumer. Each candle is crafted with the most refined food grade paraffin wax– maintaining the highest quality standards. Our fragrances are a blend of fine fragrance and pure essential oils. It’s what’s inside that makes the difference and brings a clean, true-to-life long-lasting fragrance experience. Village Candle's more than 75 fragranced candles in various sizes provide the best in home decor with their ability to enhance life's moments and add ambiance to any living space. Treat yourself to Village Candle, because you deserve the best. Made in the USA and part of the award winning Stonewall Kitchen Family of Brands, these candles brighten homes and hearts around the world.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416YTK61HEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Village Candle","source_asin":"B08J1BNK1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-971968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J1BNK1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J1BNK1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
